      "text": "[Command] is an intention to change the domain state.\nIt describes what should happen, but does\nnot guarantee that the operation will be accepted.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[Command] is an intention to change the domain state.\nIt describes what should happen, but does\nnot guarantee that the operation will be accepted.",
